(text "UtilWatch perfboard demo" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c9e9cca-c3c9-4551-a16c-3e1dd3addba5"))
(text "Same wiring as the working firmware: OLED on GPIO19 (SDA) / GPIO20 (SCL),\nbuttons on GPIO4-7 to GND with the internal pull-ups." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f71006e2-615b-4c14-8ec4-a22e6637ebb9"))
(text "Battery, NOT TESTED YET:\n- Charge through the TP4056's USB-C. GND is the TP4056 OUT-, not B- (B- sits behind its protection switch).\n- VSYS goes into the SuperMini 5V pin and its own 3.3 V regulator. Below about 3.5 V on the cell the 3V3 rail starts to sag.\n- Turn SW1 off before plugging USB into the SuperMini, or its USB 5 V pushes into the battery.\n- R1/R2 halve VSYS for GPIO0 (ADC1_CH0): 4.2 V reads as 2.1 V. They draw about 20 uA while SW1 is on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df0f5b56-9bb0-4bbb-b600-5c996956f858"))
(text "Header order is from mischianti.org's SuperMini pinout:\ncheck it against the silkscreen on your board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c474738c-c5cb-4fd8-b964-7fb66e0904d7"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
  (embedded_fonts no)
